sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  box Aqua Platform
    participant W as Web app
    participant API@{ "type": "boundary" } as Import API
  end
  actor Customer as Data Analyst
  Customer->>+W: Upload file
  W->>API: POST /imports
  alt file is valid
    API->>Queue: Enqueue job
    Queue-->>API: accepted
  else file is invalid
    API--)W: 422
  end
  Note over W,API: One import, one job
  loop every minute
    Worker->>Queue: poll
  end
  W-->>-Customer: Import started
